-- הבהרה לחוזרנו לבעלויות תשע"ו/4 ותשע"ו/5 (15.6.2016): תשלום מענק חד פעמי לעובדי הוראה
-- A clarification of owners' circulars 2015-16/4 and 2015-16/5 on the
-- one-time grant: teaching staff whose retirement on pension fell on
-- 1.1.2016 (employed up to and including 31.12.2015) are entitled to it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `הבהרה לחוזרים לבעלויות תשע"ו/4 ותשע"ו/5 — מענק חד פעמי`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 akn:hc_1/p13 akn:hc_1/p14 akn:hc_1/p15 The title, the letterhead, the date (15.6.2016), the reference number, the addressee, the greeting and the subject line; no rule.

-- Time in days from 1 September 2015 (day 0), the first day of the
-- determining period of circulars 2015-16/4 and /5.
`1.9.2015`   MEANS 0
`1.12.2015`  MEANS 91
`31.12.2015` MEANS 121
`1.1.2016`   MEANS 122

@desc A teaching employee who retired on pension, as far as the clarification asks about it.
DECLARE `retiree` HAS
    `employed from 1.9.2015`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed continuously from 1.9.2015 up to the last day of work
    `last day of work`        IS A NUMBER  @desc in days from 1.9.2015
    `day of retirement`       IS A NUMBER  @desc the day the retirement on pension took effect, in days from 1.9.2015

-- ¶16: by the Treasury wage director's circular of 22.2.2016 (which sets the
-- qualifying period; it is not reproduced here), those whose retirement fell
-- on 1.1.2016 — employed to 31.12.2015 inclusive — are NOT entitled, "a day
-- short" of the qualifying period. The period that premise implies ends on
-- 1.1.2016.
@ref akn:hc_1/p16
`the last day of the qualifying period as ¶16 implies it` MEANS `1.1.2016`

GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled under the wage director's circular as ¶16 reads it` r IF
        r's `employed from 1.9.2015`
    AND r's `last day of work` AT LEAST `the last day of the qualifying period as ¶16 implies it`

-- ¶17: after coordination with the Treasury's wages division, those whose
-- retirement fell on 1.1.2016 (employed to 31.12.2015 inclusive) ARE
-- entitled.
@ref akn:hc_1/p17
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled under the clarification` r IF
    `entitled under the wage director's circular as ¶16 reads it` r
    OR (    r's `employed from 1.9.2015`
        AND r's `day of retirement` EQUALS `1.1.2016`
        AND r's `last day of work` AT LEAST `31.12.2015`)

-- F-2015-16_tashav_04_clarif-a: the circulars this one clarifies print the
-- determining period as "מיום 1.9.2015 ועד ליום 1.12.2015" (their §1א). A
-- teacher employed to 31.12.2015 was employed through that whole period, so
-- by them is not "a day short"; ¶16's premise needs a period ending 1.1.2016.
`the end of the determining period as circulars 2015-16/4 and /5 print it` MEANS `1.12.2015`

`a teacher retiring on 1.1.2016` MEANS
    `retiree` WITH
        `employed from 1.9.2015` IS TRUE
        `last day of work`       IS `31.12.2015`
        `day of retirement`      IS `1.1.2016`

`the clarification's premise contradicts the period of the circulars it clarifies` MEANS
        NOT `entitled under the wage director's circular as ¶16 reads it` `a teacher retiring on 1.1.2016`
    AND `a teacher retiring on 1.1.2016`'s `last day of work` AT LEAST `the end of the determining period as circulars 2015-16/4 and /5 print it`
#ASSERT `the clarification's premise contradicts the period of the circulars it clarifies`

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the signatures (Sonia Peretz) and the list of copies; no rule.

-- Worked examples.
`a teacher retiring on 1.12.2015` MEANS
    `retiree` WITH
        `employed from 1.9.2015` IS TRUE
        `last day of work`       IS 90
        `day of retirement`      IS `1.12.2015`

#ASSERT `entitled under the clarification` `a teacher retiring on 1.1.2016`
#ASSERT NOT `entitled under the clarification` `a teacher retiring on 1.12.2015`
